Description
The following error occurs with JAX 0.6.1. No error is thrown with JAX 0.6.0.
The MWE reproduces the error. The gradient-via-linear transpose seems to be necessary to trigger the error - it does not have to be used and it may be deleted, but I cannot remove it. Similarly, if the linearisation is moved into the branch itself, the error disappears.
For the diagonal - this was reported to be necessary by the user who first raised the issue, I poked around a little bit and just indexing into z does not seem to be enough.
import jax
import jax.numpy as jnp


def inner_fn(x):
    z = jnp.outer(x, jnp.ones((10,)))
    return jnp.sum(jnp.diagonal(z))

def step(fn, x):
    f_eval, lin_fn = jax.linearize(fn, x)

    def with_transpose(args):
        grad = jax.linear_transpose(lin_fn, jnp.zeros_like(x))(1.0)
        del grad
        return jnp.zeros_like(x)

    def without_transpose(args):
        return jnp.zeros_like(x)

    return jax.lax.cond(f_eval > 0.1, with_transpose, without_transpose, None)

def outer_fn(x):
    return step(inner_fn, x)

jax.vmap(outer_fn)(jnp.ones((5, 10)))

